---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { currentFoster as dog, previousFosters } from '../data/fosters';
---
<BaseLayout title="Foster Dogs | Kyle Murray" description="Seven foster dogs over ten years. Meet my current foster, Linus, see photos from home, and visit his Best Friend Pet Adoption listing." image={dog.portrait}>
<main class="fosters">
  <header class="intro">
    <p class="kicker">Outside the screen</p>
    <h1>A home along the way.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Over the last ten years, I’ve fostered seven dogs. This is their little corner of my site, starting with the one currently sharing my home.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="feature" aria-labelledby="linus-title">
    <img class="portrait" src={dog.portrait} alt="Linus wearing a plaid bow tie and blue harness, looking toward the camera" width="1000" height="1333" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="feature-copy">
      <p class="kicker">Meet my current foster</p>
      <h2 id="linus-title">{dog.name}</h2>
      <p>My current houseguest. Already better dressed than most of us.</p>
      <p>Linus is a Labrador Retriever mix, about two years old and approximately 51 pounds. BFPA describes him as shy with new people, then affectionate and playful once he feels comfortable.</p>
      <p>He’s house-trained and crate-trained. I’m sharing a few moments from his time here to help him find his next home.</p>
      <a class="adopt" href={dog.listingUrl}>Meet Linus at BFPA <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <p class="fine">His Best Friend Pet Adoption listing has adoption details and the next steps for interested adopters. Please check with BFPA for current availability.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-fit" aria-labelledby="fit-title"><p class="kicker">Finding the right match</p><h2 id="fit-title">A calm home, with time to settle in.</h2><p>According to BFPA’s listing, Linus needs an adult-only home where he is the only pet, with no other dogs or cats. A yard with a six-foot fence is required.</p><p>He can be cautious around new people. A patient adopter who gives him time and space to build trust would suit him best.</p><p class="fine">Profile details from BFPA’s listing, supplied October 25, 2026. BFPA can discuss his needs, suitability and current adoption status with you.</p></section>
  <section class="moments" aria-labelledby="moments-title">
    <p class="kicker">Life in a foster home</p>
    <h2 id="moments-title">A little company. A lot of attention.</h2>
    <div class="gallery">
      <figure><img src="/images/fosters/linus-at-home.webp" alt="Linus lying beside a chair while being petted" width="1000" height="1333" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>A little attention at home.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/images/fosters/linus-company.webp" alt="Linus sitting beside a seated person who is petting him" width="1000" height="1333" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Keeping good company.</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  {previousFosters.length > 0 && <section class="archive" aria-labelledby="archive-title">
    <p class="kicker">The dogs who came before</p><h2 id="archive-title">Former houseguests</h2>
    <div class="archive-grid">{previousFosters.map(foster => <article><img src={foster.image} alt={foster.imageAlt} loading="lazy" /><h3>{foster.name}</h3><p>{foster.story}</p></article>)}</div>
  </section>}
  <aside class="closing"><h2>Seven dogs. Ten years of fostering.</h2><p>Fostering has been part of my life for a decade. I’m collecting the photos and stories of the dogs who have stayed with me here.</p><p>For now, Linus has the spotlight. If you know someone looking to adopt, please send them <a href={dog.listingUrl}>his BFPA listing</a>.</p></aside>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.fosters{--warm:#f0c995}.intro{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:40px}.kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--warm);opacity:1}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.3rem);letter-spacing:-.04em}.lede{color:var(--muted)}.feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden}.portrait{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.feature-copy{padding:clamp(24px,4vw,40px);align-self:center}.feature-copy h2{font-size:3.5rem;line-height:1;margin:12px 0 24px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.adopt{display:inline-block;background:var(--warm);color:#172435;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:750;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}.adopt:hover{background:#ffe2be}.adopt:focus-visible{outline:3px solid white;outline-offset:5px}.fine{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-top:20px}.home-fit{margin-top:48px;padding:24px 28px;border-left:3px solid var(--warm);background:var(--card);border-radius:0 12px 12px 0}.moments,.archive{margin-top:64px}.moments h2,.archive h2{font-size:1.8rem;line-height:1.25}.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:28px}.gallery figure{margin:0}.gallery img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:14px}.gallery figcaption{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.archive-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:24px}.archive img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px}.closing{border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:64px;padding-top:28px;max-width:720px}.closing h2{font-size:1.5rem}@media(max-width:640px){.feature{grid-template-columns:1fr}.portrait{height:auto}.gallery{gap:16px;grid-template-columns:1fr}.feature-copy h2{font-size:3rem}}
</style>
